# soak.script — task-46 long-session stability soak (GL + VK legs).
#
# Sustained REAL GAMEPLAY for >=10200 published frames (>=10.6 min of
# 62.5ms-frame simulation): 8 engagement cycles; each cycle rotates/
# thrusts/fires/hyperspaces for ~1050 frames, then 'n' (reset-and-return)
# + 's' (restart) re-arms 3 lives BEFORE the ship can die, so the
# simulation never settles on a static screen mid-soak. Final cycle
# coasts to natural game-over for the exit path.
# Generated by the task-46 executor (unrolled; the format has no loops).

